      "id": 478941,
      "username": "TalhaButt2508",
      "name": "Talha Butt2508",
      "created_at": "2025-08-26T06:58:49.977Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi can anyone suggest me the following:<br>\nI have a chart of accounts with all the direct expenses being posted collectively.<br>\nSo far we have 5 major product groups.<br>\nIf i make a cost center tree in a following way<br>\n-Direct Expenses<br>\n–Cost Of Sales<br>\n—Product Group A<br>\n—Product Group B</p>\n<p>How should i ammend my existing Chart Of Accounts and postings of direct expenses to comply with the proposed structure of Cost Centers without much complications.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/talhabutt2508/{size}/89640_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 25,
      "wikis": null,
